WEBVTT

00:00.294 --> 00:03.294
[lilting ukulele music]
[轻快的尤克里里音乐]

00:03.294 --> 00:09.227
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:09.227 --> 00:10.560
[water bubbling]
[水冒泡]

00:10.560 --> 00:12.227
[foghorn blows]
[雾号吹响]

00:12.227 --> 00:14.660
- [coughs, wheezes]
- [咳嗽、喘息]

00:14.660 --> 00:15.927
[foghorn blows]
[雾号吹响]

00:15.927 --> 00:18.394
[coughs, wheezes]
[咳嗽、喘息]

00:18.394 --> 00:21.227
[foghorn, coughs]
[雾号，咳嗽]

00:21.227 --> 00:24.160
[sputtering]
[溅射]

00:26.727 --> 00:27.994
- HMM.
- 唔。

00:27.994 --> 00:30.994
GARY, HAVE YOU BEEN CHEWING
ON MY ALARM CLOCK AGAIN?
加里，你咀嚼过吗
我的闹钟又响了吗？

00:30.994 --> 00:33.327
OH, WELL.
那好吧。

00:33.327 --> 00:36.794
[tape tearing]
[胶带撕裂]

00:36.794 --> 00:40.427
AHH.
- [wheezing]
啊啊。
- [喘息]

00:40.427 --> 00:41.460
- UP AND AT 'EM!
- 起来攻击他们！

00:41.460 --> 00:42.994
HUP. EW.
HUP。电子战。

00:42.994 --> 00:46.394
GARY, NOT MY SLIPPERS TOO.
加里，我的拖鞋也不是。

00:46.394 --> 00:50.060
UGH, NASTY.
呃，讨厌。

00:50.060 --> 00:51.994
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

00:51.994 --> 00:54.060
[exhales sharply, sniffs]
EW.
[急促地呼气，吸气]
电子战。

00:54.060 --> 00:57.094
ORAL HYGIENE TO THE RESCUE.
口腔卫生可以拯救。

00:57.094 --> 00:58.660
WHAT THE HEY?
什么？嘿？

00:58.660 --> 01:03.327
- [growling]
- COME ON, GARY, LET GO!
- [咆哮]
- 来吧，加里，放手！

01:03.327 --> 01:04.627
COOCHIE COOCHIE COO.
库奇库奇库奇。

01:04.627 --> 01:06.194
- [laughing]
- [笑]

01:06.194 --> 01:08.294
- GOLLY, GARY,
WHAT'S GOTTEN INTO YOU?
- 天哪，加里，
你怎么了？

01:08.294 --> 01:10.394
ARE YOU BORED?
I'LL PLAY WITH YOU LATER.
你无聊吗？
稍后我会和你一起玩。

01:10.394 --> 01:13.294
- [chewing loudly]
- GARY.
- [大声咀嚼]
- 加里。

01:22.794 --> 01:24.227
GARY, YOU ARE A NUT.
加里，你真是个疯子。

01:24.227 --> 01:25.360
SHEESH.
嘘。

01:25.360 --> 01:29.760
- [groans, chewing loudly]
- [呻吟，大声咀嚼]

01:29.760 --> 01:31.894
- THAT SNAIL SURE
IS ACTING WEIRD.
- 肯定是那只蜗牛
行为怪异。

01:31.894 --> 01:35.794
IT'S LIKE HE'S TEETHING AGAIN.
他好像又长牙了。

01:35.794 --> 01:37.394
HEY, HOLD ON A SECOND.
嘿，等一下。

01:37.394 --> 01:39.427
GARY, HAVE YOU BEEN CHEWING
ON MY BOWL?
加里，你咀嚼过吗
在我的碗上？

01:39.427 --> 01:41.560
- [spits]
NO.
- [吐口水]
没有。

01:41.560 --> 01:43.494
- I'M BEGINNING TO SENSE
A PATTERN HERE.
- 我开始感觉到了
这里有一个模式。

01:43.494 --> 01:45.960
- [chewing loudly]
- [大声咀嚼]

01:45.960 --> 01:49.194
- GARY, ARE YOU TRYING
TO TELL ME SOMETHING?
- 加里，你在尝试吗？
告诉我一些事情吗？

01:49.194 --> 01:52.060
COULD IT BE THAT WHAT YOU NEED
IS A NEW CHEW TOY?
这就是您所需要的吗
是新的咀嚼玩具吗？

01:52.060 --> 01:53.594
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

01:53.594 --> 01:55.260
- I THOUGHT SO.
- 我是这么想的。

01:58.594 --> 02:00.427
OOH, I'LL BET THEY HAVE
LOTS OF TOYS HERE.
哦，我敢打赌他们有
这里有很多玩具。

02:00.427 --> 02:01.694
HEY, LOOK, THERE'S PATRICK.
嘿，看，帕特里克在那儿。

02:01.694 --> 02:03.160
HOWDY, PATRICK.
你好，帕特里克。

02:03.160 --> 02:05.327
- HEY, SPONGEBOB.
GARETH.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。
加雷斯。

02:05.327 --> 02:08.260
- WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?
YOU DON'T HAVE A PET.
- 你在这里做什么？
您没有宠物。

02:08.260 --> 02:12.260
- CONFIDENTIALLY, I'M JUST HERE
FOR THE FREE SAMPLES.
- 保密地说，我就在这里
免费样品。

02:14.960 --> 02:18.860
MM, YOU CAN REALLY TASTE
THE GOURMET.
MM，你真的可以尝尝
美食家。

02:18.860 --> 02:21.227
WELL, THANK YOU, MA'AM.
好的，谢谢您，女士。

02:21.227 --> 02:25.127
I MAY CONSIDER PURCHASING
THIS BRAND FOR MY WORMS.
我可能会考虑购买
这个品牌适合我的蠕虫。

02:25.127 --> 02:26.394
WANT SOME?
想要一些吗？

02:26.394 --> 02:27.660
- NO, THANKS.
JUST HAD BREAKFAST.
- 不，谢谢。
刚刚吃过早餐。

02:27.660 --> 02:30.027
WE'RE HERE TO BUY GARY
A NEW TOY.
我们是来买加里的
一个新玩具。

02:30.027 --> 02:31.494
- THEY'RE ON AISLE THREE,
- 他们在第三过道，

02:31.494 --> 02:34.494
NEXT TO THE MOST DELICIOUS
SNAIL TREATS.
仅次于最美味的
蜗牛款待。

02:34.494 --> 02:36.527
FOLLOW ME.
跟我来。

02:39.594 --> 02:41.127
[chews, gulps]
[咀嚼，吞咽]

02:41.127 --> 02:42.694
HERE THEY ARE--
他们在这里——

02:42.694 --> 02:47.060
"TASTY TIME SNAIL TREATS."
“美味的蜗牛美食。”

02:47.060 --> 02:49.094
- WELL, HOW ABOUT THIS ONE?
- 嗯，这个怎么样？

02:49.094 --> 02:51.194
[toy squeaks]
[玩具吱吱声]

02:51.194 --> 02:53.760
[pops loudly]
[砰的一声]

02:53.760 --> 02:56.194
OKAY, HOW ABOUT THIS?
好的，这个怎么样？

02:56.194 --> 02:58.160
WELL?
出色地？

02:58.160 --> 02:59.594
YEAH, I DON'T THINK SO.
是的，我不这么认为。

02:59.594 --> 03:01.394
- HEY, GUYS, CHECK THIS OUT--
- 嘿，伙计们，看看这个--

03:01.394 --> 03:03.694
"PET POINT 3000."
“宠物点3000。”

03:03.694 --> 03:06.027
- A PET TOY THAT PLAYS
WITH YOUR PET.
- 会玩的宠物玩具
与您的宠物一起。

03:06.027 --> 03:07.027
WHAT DO YOU THINK, GARY?
你觉得怎么样，加里？

03:07.027 --> 03:08.794
- MEH.
- 嗯。

03:08.794 --> 03:12.394
- IT'S SO FUTURISTIC.
- 太未来主义了。

03:12.394 --> 03:16.794
[click, whirr]
[点击，呼呼]

03:16.794 --> 03:19.360
LOOK! A RED DOT!
看！一个红点！

03:19.360 --> 03:21.327
HEY, COME BACK HERE.
嘿，回到这里。

03:21.327 --> 03:22.527
- THAT'S BRILLIANT.
- 太棒了。

03:22.527 --> 03:25.194
WHAT'LL THEY THINK OF NEXT?
接下来他们会怎么想？

03:25.194 --> 03:27.160
- I LOVE THIS THING.
- 我喜欢这个东西。

03:27.160 --> 03:28.294
LET'S TURN IT UP.
让我们把它打开。

03:28.294 --> 03:29.894
[humming, sizzling]
[嗡嗡声，嘶嘶声]

03:29.894 --> 03:31.327
HUH?
嗯？

03:31.327 --> 03:32.694
WHERE DID IT GO?
它去哪儿了？

03:32.694 --> 03:34.060
- UH, PATRICK...
- 呃，帕特里克...

03:34.060 --> 03:35.160
- HUH?
- 嗯？

03:35.160 --> 03:36.794
OH, THERE IT IS.
哦，就是这样。

03:36.794 --> 03:37.894
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

03:37.894 --> 03:41.160
EH, DO YOU SMELL
SOMETHING BURNING?
呃，你闻到了吗
有东西在燃烧吗？

03:41.160 --> 03:44.460
DUH.
呃。

03:47.894 --> 03:50.660
- [snorting]
- [哼哼]

03:50.660 --> 03:53.060
HERE, YOU MIGHT NEED THIS.
在这里，您可能需要这个。

03:53.060 --> 03:55.560
YOU KNOW, I'M NOT SURE THAT TOY
IS SAFE FOR GARY.
你知道，我不确定那个玩具
对加里来说是安全的。

03:55.560 --> 03:57.094
WHERE IS GARY, ANYWAY?
加里在哪里？

03:57.094 --> 03:58.860
GARY!
加里！

03:58.860 --> 04:03.360
[harp and trumpet fanfare]
[竖琴和小号的乐曲]

04:10.360 --> 04:11.694
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

04:11.694 --> 04:13.627
[grunts]
AH.
[咕哝]
啊。

04:13.627 --> 04:15.060
[toy squeaks]
[玩具吱吱声]

04:15.060 --> 04:16.194
- GARY.
- 加里。

04:16.194 --> 04:18.327
GARY!
加里！

04:18.327 --> 04:20.460
HEY, WHERE'D YOU COME FROM?
嘿，你从哪里来？

04:20.460 --> 04:22.627
AH, I WONDER IF GARY
WOULD LIKE THIS BALL?
啊，我想知道加里
想要这个球吗？

04:22.627 --> 04:25.160
GAR--
- [panting]
加尔--
- [气喘吁吁]

04:25.160 --> 04:27.194
- I GUESS YOU DO.
- 我想你会的。

04:27.194 --> 04:29.760
ARE YOU READY TO PLAY
WITH YOUR NEW BALL?
你准备好玩了吗
用你的新球？

04:29.760 --> 04:31.260
- [panting]
- HERE IT IS, BOY.
- [气喘吁吁]
- 就是这里，男孩。

04:31.260 --> 04:32.894
- [grunts]
- YOU WANT IT, BOY?
- [咕哝]
- 你想要吗，男孩？

04:32.894 --> 04:35.894
- [grunts]
- OKAY, BOY, GO AND GET IT.
- [咕哝]
- 好吧，孩子，去拿吧。

04:35.894 --> 04:36.994
GO AND GET IT.
去拿吧。

04:36.994 --> 04:38.727
GO AND GET IT.
- [growling]
去拿吧。
- [咆哮]

04:38.727 --> 04:41.160
- FETCH!
- [grunts]
- 拿来！
- [咕哝]

04:41.160 --> 04:43.160
- OKAY, GARY, BRING IT BACK.
- 好吧，加里，把它拿回来。

04:43.160 --> 04:45.094
[toy squeaking]
[玩具吱吱声]

04:45.094 --> 04:46.660
COME ON, GARY.
BRING IT BACK, GARY.
来吧，加里。
把它带回来，加里。

04:46.660 --> 04:49.294
YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO BRING IT...
BACK.
你应该带它...
返回。

04:49.294 --> 04:52.294
- [growling]
[toy squeaking]
- [咆哮]
[玩具吱吱声]

04:53.960 --> 04:56.227
[growling]
[toy squeaking]
[咆哮]
[玩具吱吱声]

04:56.227 --> 04:59.160
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:02.694 --> 05:05.627
- OH, WELL, AS LONG AS
HE'S NOT CHEWING ON MY STUFF.
- 哦，好吧，只要
他没有嚼我的东西。

05:05.627 --> 05:08.127
- [humming]
[toy squeaking]
- [嗡嗡声]
[玩具吱吱声]

05:13.760 --> 05:15.060
- I WONDER HOW GARY'S DOING.
- 我想知道加里怎么样了。

05:15.060 --> 05:16.460
I HAVEN'T HEARD A SQUEAK
OUT OF HIM.
我没有听到吱吱声
从他身上。

05:16.460 --> 05:18.294
GARY? ARE--
加里？是 -

05:18.294 --> 05:20.060
HMM.
WHERE IS THAT SNAIL?
唔。
那只蜗牛在哪里？

05:20.060 --> 05:21.560
GARY, WHERE ARE YOU?
加里，你在哪里？

05:21.560 --> 05:22.560
GARY, I--
加里，我——

05:22.560 --> 05:27.294
OH, THERE YOU ARE.
哦，你来了。

05:27.294 --> 05:28.827
OH, A TEA PARTY.
哦，茶会。

05:28.827 --> 05:30.294
CUTE.
可爱的。

05:30.294 --> 05:31.794
DO YOU MIND IF I JOIN YOU?
你介意我加入吗？

05:31.794 --> 05:33.460
I'D JUST LOVE A SPOT OF TEA.
我只是喜欢喝点茶。

05:33.460 --> 05:34.660
WHAT KIND OF TEA IS IT--
这是什么茶——

05:34.660 --> 05:38.060
GREEN TEA, EARL GREY, OOLONG,
SLIPPERY ELM?
绿茶、伯爵茶、乌龙茶、
滑榆树？

05:38.060 --> 05:40.994
[wheels squeaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

05:43.227 --> 05:46.760
GEE, I THINK HE LIKES THAT BALL
MORE THAN ME.
哎呀，我想他喜欢那个球
比我多。

05:46.760 --> 05:48.827
[slurps, spits]
YECH.
[吸吮，吐口水]
是的。

05:48.827 --> 05:51.727
THAT IS NOT TEA.
那不是茶。

05:51.727 --> 05:53.660
I KNOW WHAT WILL GET
GARY'S ATTENTION--
我知道会得到什么
加里的注意——

05:53.660 --> 05:56.694
GOOD OLD SLIMYCAN.
好旧的史莱米罐。

05:56.694 --> 05:59.627
[whirring]
[呼呼]

06:08.094 --> 06:11.394
HERE YA GO, GA--
来吧，佐治亚州——

06:11.394 --> 06:12.627
DARN IT, GARY.
该死的，加里。

06:12.627 --> 06:14.960
GARY! DINNERTIME!
加里！晚餐时间！

06:14.960 --> 06:17.160
GARY.
加里。

06:17.160 --> 06:19.227
GARY?
[dramatic music]
加里？
[戏剧音乐]

06:19.227 --> 06:21.060
[shouts]
[喊叫]

06:21.060 --> 06:22.727
OKAY, THAT'S JUST CREEPY.
好吧，这太令人毛骨悚然了。

06:22.727 --> 06:25.594
GARY, I THINK YOU NEED TO SPEND
SOME TIME AWAY FROM THIS BALL.
加里，我认为你需要花钱
离这个球还有一段时间。

06:27.560 --> 06:29.327
THIS ISN'T HELPING YOUR CASE.
这对你的案子没有帮助。

06:31.460 --> 06:33.560
- [snores, grunts]
[door opens, closes]
- [打鼾、咕噜声]
[门打开，关闭]

06:33.560 --> 06:34.727
- OKAY, GARY, FUN IS FUN.
- 好吧，加里，有趣就是有趣。

06:34.727 --> 06:37.694
NOW, GIVE ME THAT BALL, PRONTO.
- [grunts]
现在，把球给我，马上。
- [咕哝]

06:37.694 --> 06:40.694
- OH, SO YOU'VE HIDDEN IT.
- 哦，所以你把它藏起来了。

06:40.694 --> 06:42.627
OH, NO, YOU DON'T.
COME HERE.
哦，不，你不知道。
来这里。

06:42.627 --> 06:45.427
I BET I KNOW WHERE IT IS.
我打赌我知道它在哪里。

06:47.360 --> 06:50.594
[sighs]
HAIRBALL.
[叹气]
毛球。

06:50.594 --> 06:52.560
HAIRBALL.
毛球。

06:52.560 --> 06:53.660
WALLET.
钱包。

06:53.660 --> 06:55.227
DARN IT--
I THOUGHT I LOST THIS.
该死的——
我以为我失去了这个。

06:55.227 --> 06:57.594
AND I JUST CANCELED
MY CREDIT CARDS.
我刚刚取消了
我的信用卡。

06:57.594 --> 07:00.160
HAIRBALL, TOOTHBRUSH...
毛球、牙刷...

07:00.160 --> 07:02.127
AHA!
I KNEW IT.
啊哈！
我就知道。

07:02.127 --> 07:03.227
YOU'LL SEE.
你会看到的。

07:03.227 --> 07:04.727
SOME TIME APART
WILL DO YOU GOOD.
分开一段时间
会对你有好处。

07:07.594 --> 07:10.060
THERE WE GO.
OUT OF SIGHT, OUT OF MIND.
我们开始了。
眼不见心不烦。

07:10.060 --> 07:14.427
I KNOW YOU'RE UPSET NOW,
BUT WAIT UNTIL TOMORROW MORNING.
我知道你现在很沮丧
但请等到明天早上。

07:14.427 --> 07:18.194
WHY, YOU PROBABLY WON'T
EVEN REMEMBER THAT OLD BALL.
为什么，你可能不会
甚至还记得那个旧球。

07:18.194 --> 07:22.260
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

07:27.894 --> 07:30.427
[foghorn blows]
- [wheezing, crash]
[雾号吹响]
- [喘息，崩溃]

07:30.427 --> 07:31.860
- GOOD MORNING, GARY.
- 早上好，加里。

07:31.860 --> 07:34.160
I HOPE YOU'RE
NOT STILL MAD AT ME.
我希望你是
还没生我的气。

07:34.160 --> 07:35.527
GARY?
加里？

07:35.527 --> 07:37.360
THE BALL.
[gasps]
球。
[喘气]

07:37.360 --> 07:40.227
I WILL NOT TOLERATE
THIS DISOBEDIENCE, GARY.
我不会容忍
这种不服从，加里。

07:40.227 --> 07:41.460
GARY, I'M NOT PLAYING AROUND.
加里，我不是在开玩笑。

07:41.460 --> 07:44.194
YOU HAD BETTER SHOW YOURSELF
THIS INSTANT.
你最好展示一下自己
这一刻。

07:44.194 --> 07:46.127
OKAY, GET DOWN HERE.
好的，到这里来。

07:46.127 --> 07:47.294
[toy squeaking]
[玩具吱吱声]

07:47.294 --> 07:49.294
HMPH.
HMPH。
HMPH。
HMPH。
HMPH。
HMPH。
HMPH。
HMPH。

07:49.294 --> 07:52.294
GARY, GIVE ME THAT BALL.
加里，把球给我。

07:52.294 --> 07:53.527
[toy squeaking]
[玩具吱吱声]

07:53.527 --> 07:55.227
COME ON.
快点。

07:55.227 --> 07:56.260
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:56.260 --> 07:57.694
GET DOWN.
下来。

07:57.694 --> 08:00.394
[grunts]
[toy continues squeaking]
[咕哝]
[玩具继续吱吱作响]

08:00.394 --> 08:02.527
WHOA!
哇啊！

08:02.527 --> 08:05.127
MOTHER ALWAYS SAID,
"DON'T RUN WITH THE BROOM."
母亲总是说，
“不要拿着扫帚跑。”

08:05.127 --> 08:07.427
[toy squeaking]
[玩具吱吱声]

08:09.560 --> 08:10.660
I'LL TAKE THAT.
我会接受的。

08:10.660 --> 08:11.960
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

08:11.960 --> 08:14.460
[gasps]
GARY, HOW COULD YOU?
[喘气]
加里，你怎么能？

08:14.460 --> 08:16.460
YOU ARE GONNA HAVE
TO MAKE A CHOICE.
你将会拥有
做出选择。

08:16.460 --> 08:18.894
IT'S EITHER ME OR THE...
要么是我，要么是……

08:18.894 --> 08:20.460
[toy squeaking]
BALL.
[玩具吱吱声]
球。

08:20.460 --> 08:21.860
FINE.
[squeaking continues]
美好的。
[吱吱声继续]

08:21.860 --> 08:25.360
I HOPE YOU TWO
WILL BE VERY HAPPY TOGETHER...
我希望你们两个
在一起会很开心...

08:25.360 --> 08:26.894
WITHOUT ME.
没有我。

08:26.894 --> 08:28.394
GOOD-BYE!
再见！

08:28.394 --> 08:30.794
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

08:30.794 --> 08:32.960
[toy squeaking]
[玩具吱吱声]

08:34.960 --> 08:38.894
[stomach grumbling,
lips smacking]
[肚子咕咕叫，
咂嘴]

08:38.894 --> 08:41.827
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:41.827 --> 08:43.560
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:43.560 --> 08:46.027
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:46.027 --> 08:50.094
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:50.094 --> 08:55.060
- BLAH, BLAH, BLOO, BLEE, BLAH,
BLAH, BLOO, BLAH, BLAH, BLEE.
- 废话，废话，废话，废话，废话，
巴拉，巴拉，巴拉，巴拉，布莱。

08:55.060 --> 08:58.194
BLAH BLAHHH.
[sobbing]
巴拉巴拉。
[抽泣]

08:58.194 --> 09:00.860
- [whimpering, crying]
- [呜咽，哭泣]

09:02.060 --> 09:06.360
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

09:10.327 --> 09:13.894
- [grunts]
- [whistling]
- [咕哝]
- [吹口哨]

09:13.894 --> 09:17.727
[train whistle sounds]
[火车汽笛声]

09:17.727 --> 09:18.727
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

09:18.727 --> 09:21.627
[growling]
[toy squeaking]
[咆哮]
[玩具吱吱声]

09:27.794 --> 09:30.060
[growling]
[咆哮]

09:33.294 --> 09:35.527
[whirring]
[呼呼]

09:35.527 --> 09:37.294
[ricocheting]
[跳弹]

09:42.494 --> 09:43.494
[whoosh]
[嗖嗖]

09:43.494 --> 09:44.927
[electricity crackling]
[电力噼啪声]

09:52.227 --> 09:54.294
AND SO IT'S COME TO THIS--
事情就到了这一步——

09:54.294 --> 09:57.027
NO HOME, NO BEST FRIEND...
[sniffles]
没有家，没有最好的朋友......
[抽鼻子]

09:57.027 --> 10:01.027
AND SLEEPING UNDER A BUS STOP.
并在公交车站下睡觉。

10:01.027 --> 10:02.994
HELLO, LITTLE NEMATODE.
你好，小线虫。

10:02.994 --> 10:04.827
WILL YOU BE MY FRIEND?
你愿意成为我的朋友吗？

10:04.827 --> 10:06.627
THAT A BOY.
那是一个男孩。

10:06.627 --> 10:10.060
[giggles]
THAT TICKLES!
[咯咯笑]
好痒啊！

10:10.060 --> 10:12.827
HEY, MY WALLET!
嘿，我的钱包！

10:12.827 --> 10:14.460
GOOD THING I CANCELED
THOSE CREDIT CARDS.
还好我取消了
那些信用卡。

10:14.460 --> 10:15.460
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:15.460 --> 10:16.560
- GARY.
- 加里。

10:16.560 --> 10:18.594
I MEAN--OH, HEY.
我的意思是——哦，嘿。

10:18.594 --> 10:21.460
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE--
WAITING FOR A BUS?
你在这里做什么——
等公交车？

10:21.460 --> 10:24.027
[slurping]
[发出声音]

10:24.027 --> 10:25.527
OH, GARY.
哦，加里。

10:25.527 --> 10:28.560
DOES THIS MEAN YOU'VE COME TO
LOVE ME MORE THAN THAT CHEW TOY?
这是否意味着您已经来到
爱我胜过爱那个咀嚼玩具？

10:28.560 --> 10:29.660
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:29.660 --> 10:32.027
- YIPPEE!
- 耶皮！

10:32.027 --> 10:35.160
LOOK, WE'RE CLOSER THAN EVER.
[laughs]
看，我们比以往任何时候都更接近。
[笑]

10:35.160 --> 10:37.160
COME ON, GARY, LET'S GO HOME.
来吧，加里，我们回家吧。

10:37.160 --> 10:38.694
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

10:38.694 --> 10:39.860
DO YOU SMELL SOMETHING BURNING?
您闻到什么烧焦的味道了吗？

10:39.860 --> 10:43.727
[explosion, whistling]
[爆炸声、呼啸声]

10:43.727 --> 10:45.527
HEY, LOOK,
ISN'T THAT YOUR BALL?
嘿，看，
那不是你的球吗？

10:45.527 --> 10:48.160
- [hissing]
- [嘶嘶声]

- [嘶嘶声]